message: >-
  If you refer to this work, please cite the paper. When the exact bytes of
  the verification artifact matter, also cite the archived Zenodo version.
title: >-
  Extending DBLog-Based Incremental Snapshots to Handle Orphan Rows in CDC
  Pipelines: paper sources and formal verification artifact
abstract: >-
  Paper sources and formal verification artifact for "Extending DBLog-Based
  Incremental Snapshots to Handle Orphan Rows in CDC Pipelines." The paper
  sources are those posted to arXiv. The artifact (Isabelle/HOL, Lean 4, TLA+)
  is byte-identical to its archived Zenodo version 1.0 deposit.
